      "writtenOn": "2019-03-05T14:57:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Keystone is in an interesting place with the member role. There aren\u0027t many APIs in keystone that justify the member role.\n\nFor most purposes in keystone, the member role is effectively the `reader` role. We included the `member` role during the bootstrap process so that other projects have a little more flexibility.\n\nThe policies here are hypothetical, just to show an example of how a developer could write policies for another service.",
